{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01UM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$g : Y \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$p : X \\times_S Y \\to X$", "MATH_0004": "$q : X \\times_S Y \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$$\np^*\\Omega_{X/S} \\oplus q^*\\Omega_{Y/S}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\Omega_{X \\times_S Y/S}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-functoriality-differentials}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-differential-product}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c9fb32ce3f6203271f37c1f3972b17a9efd61d525e0ea0bd873b176a5ff58c38", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ffc55cd8cec27bb73790a778256cc54fde478a5dccd0f4e25988b6d8e83178d7", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be morphisms of schemes with the same\ntarget. Let <MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004> be the\nprojection morphisms. The maps from\nLemma <REF_0001>\n<MATH_0005>\ngive an isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0f1ad8726fae1fe2e63f6fa85e48e06626422d3c3dfb768159bcc3650868bd48", "unit_id": "tag:01V1:statement"}
